  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 4, ODRL Shared Properties: a Policy linked to Rule 1, Rule 2 and so on to Rule n. Dashed arrows show properties declared once on the Policy and shared by all its Rules: the function properties assigner and assignee to a Party (uid), the relation property target to an Asset, and action to an Action.",
